    <string name="guia_1_titulo">Welcome to Kiwu</string>
    <string name="guia_1_texto">Your tasks, notes and class schedule in one place. Everything is saved on your phone.</string>
    <string name="guia_2_titulo">Tasks in lists and folders</string>
    <string name="guia_2_texto">Create a list per subject and group lists into folders. Open the ☰ menu to see them and tap a task\'s checkbox to complete it.</string>
    <string name="guia_3_titulo">Dates, reminders and events</string>
    <string name="guia_3_texto">Give a task a date and Kiwu reminds you beforehand. Events (birthdays, talks) show up in the calendar and don\'t need completing.</string>
    <string name="guia_4_titulo">Notes and schedule</string>
    <string name="guia_4_texto">In Notes you write notes with headings, lists, code and images. In Schedule you add your classes and see each one\'s tasks.</string>
    <string name="guia_5_titulo">Your streak</string>
    <string name="guia_5_texto">Keep your due dates up to date to build a streak: a day with classes counts if you complete or add a task, and days off don\'t break it. In the evening we remind you if it\'s about to be lost.</string>
